> So what is the secret to playing priests?  Or are they generally impossible?
Yes. Priests are hard to start with. What you should make is starting with
a priest that has both high strength and constitution. Ex. str:16, con:18 is
very good starting point. If you have such a caracter and are able to get
poison resistance and a excelent weapon your success is ready.
   If you have extra food (rations) and find a altar stay on the level.
Convert altar and keep offering corpses. If you kill something too far away
from altar eat it. You can rest close to altar and wait for monsters to
appear. Every now and then you should check for nonmoving monsters on the
level. When you run out of extra food go hunting to next levels.
   Pray only for food (unless you are in a impossible situation). Don't stay
on a level too long. It will become crowded with monsters.


